<title>USA: Alamco hires adviser; weighs sale, merger.</title>
<headline>Alamco hires adviser; weighs sale, merger.</headline>
<dateline>CLARKSBURG, W. Va 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alamco Inc said it has hired Principal Financial Securities Inc to help it explore strategic alternatives that could include the sale or merger of part or all of the company.</p>
<p>The independent oil and natural gas producer said it has not made any determination that the company will be sold or merged or that such a transaction would be in the best interest of shareholders.</p>
<p>((New York Newsdesk, 212/859-1700))</p>
